{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1488846-inheritance-untouched","id":1488846,"title":"Inheritance Untouched","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-02T10:26:24-07:00","id":1488846,"title":"Inheritance Untouched","content":"In his obituary, my American paternal grandfather was credited with some rank in the Freemasons. His involvement in the order had mostly concluded by the time we started taking trips down to see my grandparents, when my sister and I were very young. He had retired early. Over the years, we lost contact following my parents' divorce. I was informed of a fund in my name that my grandfather had created. I left it untouched. Dividends are automatically reinvested until such time that I claim it.<br /> <br /> Recently, I came across an interview with Barret Brown on the Konkrete Podcast. This <a href=\"https://youtu.be/-JyCgvecpE8?t=1801\" target=\"_blank\">link</a> is to a point in the interview just before mention of the Bhopal Chemical Disaster in India. As it was told to me, there was a point when a lawsuit was being ruled on. I don't claim this to be precisely accurate, only what I was told. The story went that my grandfather, a stock trader, attended a meeting with his fraternal brothers. He left that meeting believing that he knew how the judge in the Bhopal case was going to rule - against the families of dead and injured workers. He sold his car. He sold every stick of furniture in the house and took out a second mortgage. He bought preferred shares in Dow Chemical whose share value was negatively affected in the short term by the pending lawsuit. He retired comfortably.<br /> <br /> Should I access the funds?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-02T10:54:06-07:00","id":1488854,"title":"","content":"Why wouldn't you? I can't think of a reason not to, unless you want to save it for something big?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Prone to being a Classic Curmudgeon, goshdarned whippersnappers...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1037-jamiemalk","name":"jamiemalk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1037_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-02T12:13:30-07:00","id":1488865,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>jamiemalk</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1488846-inheritance-untouched?p=1488854#post1488854\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why wouldn't you? I can't think of a reason not to, unless you want to save it for something big?</div> </div> </div> </div>Something big is a question in my mind. There's a list of things I keep putting off and juggling. Buy a new mattress, buy crypto, replace a graphics card, buy a new beast of a computer, buy software tools, hire a literature student or invest in health. The last would <i>not</i> include a gym membership, because they have become such a ripoff where the gym owner oversells memberships and makes the whole process of getting a workout so miserable that you never go back - &quot;Here's a tiny locker. Don't forget to change into the shoes you were forced to buy only for my gym while the two people beside you block your access. A single bead of sweat left on a machine gets you a public shaming.&quot;. Electric bicycles are coming down in price to where I would consider buying one. Next Spring.<br /> <br /> Hiring someone with formal writing skills could be expanded into something bigger. I have had undiagnosed ADHD all my life and have been gradually improving the skills I seek to compliment since beginning treatment. It might be better to wait until my own creative process is as efficient as I can make it before determining what I want the other person to do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-13T16:24:43-07:00","id":1490075,"title":"","content":"The money is yours. Even your grandfather had little to no actual influence on the outcome of the ruling, he just made an extremely risky bet and won.<br /> <br /> About what to do with it, that depends a lot on your financial conditions now, your current stability, future prospects and just how much money we're talking about. But QoL things like a new mattress and maybe some adapting tools for your ADHD probably should come first.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-16T09:34:51-07:00","id":1490404,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1488846-inheritance-untouched?p=1490075#post1490075\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The money is yours. Even your grandfather had little to no actual influence on the outcome of the ruling, he just made an extremely risky bet and won.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is s true.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1488846-inheritance-untouched?p=1490075#post1490075\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">About what to do with it, that depends a lot on your financial conditions now, your current stability, future prospects and just how much money we're talking about. But QoL things like a new mattress and maybe some adapting tools for your ADHD probably should come first.</div> </div> </div> </div>The only ADHD Adapting Tools that I'm aware of are software for organizing projects, like Evernote. I feel like Bill Gates already knows enough about what I do in Windows. Opening myself to ever more data miners - I'm not sure. <br /> <br /> There is another consideration. It doesn't make logical or pragmatic sense, but it might b what I need to do. Maybe I will post on this in the future.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-16T18:09:47-07:00","id":1490466,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1488846-inheritance-untouched?p=1490404#post1490404\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is another consideration. It doesn't make logical or pragmatic sense, but it might b what I need to do. Maybe I will post on this in the future.</div> </div> </div> </div>On your time. You may also send me a PM if you prefer.<br /> <br /> Either way do not worry too much about it making pragmatic sense at first. If it is a relevant consideration, there is a reason.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-20T18:07:28-07:00","id":1495338,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1488846-inheritance-untouched#post1488846\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">. . . I was informed of a fund in my name that my grandfather had created. I left it untouched. Dividends are automatically reinvested until such time that I claim it.<br /> . . .<br /> <br /> Should I access the funds?</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't touch it!<br /> <br /> Inheritance won't last forever, but usually, the dividends will. <br /> <br /> I'm in a similar-situation; I just like my divs go into a separate account and let them build while I wait for the market to plunge. I still work, though, I am still living off of the funeral expenses my Grandfather's estate allocated to me; my relatives all got first-class plane-tickets and luxury hotel-rooms; I took the bus there (Greyhound is an experience). <br /> <br /> I do like the fact you're reinvesting it; just look at the account maintenance-fees. I've had stocks since I was in elementary-school and I had them reinvest, which over time, grew my portfolio.<br /> <br /> <br /> Save if for an emergency fund or if one day, you want to take out a loan. <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-31T02:15:29-07:00","id":1495955,"title":"","content":"I think you have to get access to the funds. It's your inheritance and your money.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27589-seylen","name":"seylen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-31T19:59:08-07:00","id":1496017,"title":"","content":"I've resolved it. Thanks all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}